 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c         | 102 ++++++++++++++
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe_debugfs.c | 171 ++++++++++++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 267 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

